<title>USA: TABLE-DSG Int'l Q2 shr $0.21 vs $0.29.</title>
<headline>TABLE-DSG Int'l Q2 shr $0.21 vs $0.29.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.21		    $0.29</p>
<p> Net			  1,418		    2,278</p>
